{"model":"gpt-6-luna","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You inspect repositories with the bash tool.\nEvery factual claim must come from bash output.\nUse bash at least 3 separate times.\nNever combine commands with && or ;."},{"role":"user","content":"Inspect the repository. You must use bash at least 3 separate times and do not combine commands with && or ;. Run each as a separate bash call, exactly: (1) pwd (2) ls examples\/D05_AgentTroubleshooting (3) rg -n \"UseSubagents|SpawnSubagentTool|SubagentSpawning\" packages\/agents\/src\/Capability\/Subagent\/*.php packages\/agents\/src\/Events\/Subagent*.php. Then investigate enough to answer: what kind of repository this is, where agent telemetry examples live, and what the subagent telemetry path records. Return concise evidence."},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_WUrIR0pis8mjI4qveU4YbX0s","type":"function","function":{"name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"pwd\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_WUrIR0pis8mjI4qveU4YbX0s","content":"\/Users\/ddebowczyk\/projects\/_instructor\/instructor-php\n"},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_W7csZVGBBFEe2GnKr4mZi9Sr","type":"function","function":{"name":"bash","arguments":"{\"command\":\"ls examples\\\/D05_AgentTroubleshooting\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_W7csZVGBBFEe2GnKr4mZi9Sr","content":"EventLogReadbackAgent\nSubagentTelemetryLangfuse\nSubagentTelemetryLogfire\nTelemetryLangfuse\nTelemetryLogfire\n"}],"parallel_tool_calls":false,"max_completion_tokens":1024,"tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"bash","description":"Execute a bash command and return bounded stdout\/stderr. Use for shell operations, not file reading.\n\nExamples:\n- \"git status\" \u2192 check git state\n- \"composer install\" \u2192 install dependencies\n- \"php artisan migrate\" \u2192 run migrations\n- \"grep -r 'TODO' src\/\" \u2192 search file contents\n- \"npm run build\" \u2192 run build scripts\n\nPrefer dedicated file tools over cat, sed-based rewrites, and shell redirection.\nIf output is truncated, narrow the command or redirect it to a file and inspect it with the dedicated read tool.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"command":{"type":"string","description":"The bash command to execute"}},"required":["command"],"additionalProperties":false}}}],"tool_choice":"auto","reasoning_effort":"none"}